# All protocols orchestrator

Runs the three job-search agent protocols **in sequence** when Cary says **run protocols**.

**Trigger phrases:** `run protocols`, `run all protocols`, `all protocols`

Individual protocols still run alone via their own triggers (`run response protocol`, `run Google protocol`, `run LinkedIn protocol`).

---

## Run protocols (checklist)

When the user says **run protocols**, execute **all three** protocols below **in this order**. Complete each protocol's full checklist before starting the next. If one phase fails, report it and continue where possible.

### 1 — Response protocol

Read and follow **`tools/response/.prompt`** end-to-end (all phases). Produce that protocol's summary report.

Focus: recruiter **replies** to submitted apps (`applied` / `interview`); Gmail + LinkedIn InMail follow-up drafts. **Never auto-send.**

### 2 — Google protocol

Read and follow **`tools/gmail/.prompt`** end-to-end (all phases). Produce that protocol's summary report.

Focus: Cloud Run scan, GCS sync, Gmail inbox JSON, new recruiter mail triage, reply drafts for intake threads. **Never auto-send** (`--send`).

### 3 — LinkedIn protocol

Read and follow **`tools/linkedin/.prompt`** end-to-end (all phases). Produce that protocol's summary report.

Focus: LinkedIn alerts + search, JD fetch/score, tailoring ≥80%, Easy Apply / external apply / InMail drafts. **Never auto-submit or auto-send.**

---

## Combined summary

After all three complete, produce one **combined summary** with sections:

1. **Response** — threads found, drafts prepared, status updates
2. **Google** — inbox sync, new mail, drafts, triage
3. **LinkedIn** — search/alert hits, scores, new applications, apply/InMail actions pending approval

Call out anything needing Cary's manual action (file uploads, Easy Apply, send approval, login checkpoints).
